# Red and black mana cannot pay Circle of Protection: Green's {W} (CR 601.2h); with white it is cast. With no
# green source anywhere - Ornithopter is colorless, the Circle white - its ability can still be activated and resolves
# without asking for an empty choice (the ruling: "Can be used even when there is no damage to prevent"; CR 609.7a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Circle of Protection: Green
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Circle of Protection: Green.Cast(Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Circle of Protection: Green.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Circle of Protection: Green.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
